subject: How to file a request
sender: Farid Haddad
fold_from: none
authored: When you write to the helpdesk, fill in the fields like this:
authored: From: your own work address, never a private one
authored: To: the helpdesk queue of your site
authored: Subject: one line that names the device and the problem
authored: That way the request reaches the right team the first time.
--- text
When you write to the helpdesk, fill in the fields like this:

From: your own work address, never a private one
To: the helpdesk queue of your site
Subject: one line that names the device and the problem

That way the request reaches the right team the first time.
